TITLE Ca-Sr carbonate solid solution question
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7
    Ca 0.01
    Sr 0.01
    Alkalinity 0.04 as HCO3

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Strontianite 0 0

SOLID_SOLUTIONS 1
    Ca_Sr_carbonate
        -comp Calcite 0.0
        -comp Strontianite 0.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file q1.sel
    -activities Ca+2
    -pH true
END
